title: "Shear Mapping in Python (SMPy): Modular, Extensible, and Accessible Dark Matter Mapping"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23710091
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  SMPy makes convergence maps from weak lensing galaxy shear catalogs with
  Kaiser-Squires inversion, KS+ and aperture mass, together with
  signal-to-noise maps, celestial and pixel coordinates, and plotting.
